sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer (Browser/WhatsApp)
    participant API as WefyLabs API (FastAPI)
    participant AI as AI Gateway (LLM Router)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant CAL as Calendar (Google OAuth)
    participant CELERY as Celery Workers

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 1 — Lead Capture
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/leads/ingestion {name, phone, budget}
    API->>DB: INSERT lead + identity record (tenant scoped)
    API->>CELERY: dispatch enrichment task
    DB-->>API: lead_id
    API-->>C: 201 Created {lead_id}

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 2 — AI Conversation + Qualification
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/ai-agent/v1/message {content, lead_id, org_id}
    API->>AI: route(context, qualification_state, property_facts)
    AI->>DB: read memory, qualification facts
    AI-->>API: structured response + qualification_updates
    API->>DB: UPDATE qualification_facts
    API-->>C: AI response + shortlisted properties

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 3 — Property Shortlist + Matching
    C->>API: GET /api/v1/recommendations/?lead_id={id}
    API->>DB: read buyer_profile + active property_listings
    API-->>C: Ranked shortlist with compatibility scores

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 4 — Appointment Booking (AI Tool Call)
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/ai-agent/v1/message {content: "Book Saturday 3pm", confirmed_action: true}
    API->>AI: tool_call: get_available_slots
    AI->>DB: check MeetingHold + confirmed Meetings
    AI->>CAL: GET free_busy(broker_calendar, Sat 3pm)
    CAL-->>AI: slot available
    API->>AI: tool_call: book_viewing (confirmed)
    AI->>DB: INSERT MeetingHold (5min lock)
    AI->>CAL: POST create_event
    CAL-->>AI: google_event_id
    AI->>DB: INSERT Meeting + Viewing + Activity
    AI->>DB: DELETE MeetingHold
    API-->>C: Booking confirmed, calendar invite sent

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 5 — Site Visit + Outcome
    API->>API: POST /api/v1/calendar/viewings/{id}/outcome
    API->>DB: INSERT MeetingOutcome {VERY_INTERESTED, interest_level:5}
    API->>DB: UPDATE Lead.pipeline_stage = "viewing_completed"
    API->>CELERY: dispatch process_site_visit_completed_task

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 6 — Revenue Autopilot Triggers
    CELERY->>DB: query leads with completed viewings < 48h
    CELERY->>DB: INSERT RevenueOpportunity {POST_SITE_VISIT_FOLLOW_UP}
    CELERY->>CELERY: schedule follow_up enrollment

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 7 — Human Handoff (if needed)
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/ai-agent/v1/message {content: "I want to talk to a human"}
    API->>AI: escalation_detector.detect(human_requested=True)
    AI->>DB: INSERT Escalation + UPDATE AgentSession.escalated=True
    API->>DB: INSERT Activity {human_handoff_requested}
    API-->>C: "Connecting you with a specialist..."
    Note over AI: AI generation suppressed for this session

    Note over C,CELERY: Step 8 — Follow-Up Automation
    CELERY->>DB: evaluate follow_up_rules for lead
    CELERY->>DB: INSERT FollowUpExecution {channel: email}
    CELERY-->>C: Personalized follow-up message sent
